WEBVTT

00:01:29.329 --> 00:01:31.246
But somewhere along the way,

00:01:31.288 --> 00:01:33.121
we lost our balance.

00:01:33.871 --> 00:01:35.871
In fact, think about this.

00:01:35.871 --> 00:01:37.121
Scientists are considering

00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:39.788
whether for the very first time
in human history,

00:01:39.788 --> 00:01:42.538
instead of the planet shaping humans,

00:01:42.538 --> 00:01:45.288
humans are knowingly shaping the planet.

00:01:45.663 --> 00:01:48.246
It's called the Anthropocene

00:01:48.288 --> 00:01:51.329
and it represents a new geological era.

00:01:51.329 --> 00:01:54.663
Today, humans literally have the power
to alter the atmosphere

00:01:54.704 --> 00:01:56.663
and the biosphere in which we live.

00:01:56.704 --> 00:01:59.913
The power to destroy
and the power to repair.